        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We will have to agree to disgree. &nbsp;I see it as a story with Gloomweaver in space. &nbsp;You don’t see it that way and that’s fine. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's a story&nbsp;with Gloomweaver in space, yes.&nbsp; That's what I've been saying.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It is not a Gloomweaver Story in space.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Edits: clarity</p>",
